      "value": "I have one PC where I virtualize windows server, ubuntu server, openwrt router, gaming machine, personal computer and my work station computer. You don't want to have anticheats in background when working with confidential customer's data. And I don't have money to own everything mentioned as standalone device. It's much cheaper, stable, running in RAID disks, lower power consumption etc. It's perfect solution for me. And here we have anticheats that ruin everything. I don't plan to own a standalone windows 11 PC. It's awful unreliable slow piece of latest microslop invention. VRchat was a place where I could go after work and have fun or relax a bit after stressful day. And I'm done. Everything that Epic touches ruins.",
