      "value": "at this point im starting to lose hope.... id love to see vrchat working on shadow agian aswell as many other games that utilize eac. i always used it to still have a way to hangout with friends on vr due to conflicting scedules or either i wasnt anywhere near my headset not to mention actually playing it with pcvr it was so much better than quest and it was so much more accessible than buying a pc that costs what? a couple thousand but like multiple people have said its really just up to vrchat as now we know they have the option to just turn vr exclusion off- \"but the cheaters would run wild\" honestly arent they already?? i mean i see cheaters in murder 4 and such all the time... well not SUPER often but its not even suprising atp. we really do just gotta hope and wait. hope they see all of us and dont just brush us off since we are quite a small minority of the vrchat playerbase.... maybe one day itll be back though",
